contentText:
Beloved Dutch trio Noisia are reuniting after seven years apart.

The group — Nik Roos, Martijn van Sonderen and Thijs de Vlieger — announced Thursday (Sept. 17) that they&#8217;re reforming the project. A press release about the reunion notes that after spending the last seven years focused on their respective solo projects, the three guys missed &#8220;the exchange of ideas between them, and the feedback loop that begins when their music meets a crowd.&#8221;

